  // _regsTop is the next free slot (= base of the hypothetical next frame).
  // On CALL:   newBase = _regsTop; _regsTop += HEADER_SIZE + fn.regCount
  // On RETURN: _regsTop = <returning frame's base>   (pop the whole block)
